---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: ScopeInterface[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for runClarifications. Form precise clarification requests describing the disputed boundary and desired acceptance. Interpret replies at the commitment level, preserve qualifications, and avoid treating general cooperation language as acceptance of a specific responsibility. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
